    "details": "Cary Phillips reports:\n\n> OpenEXR 3.4.10 is a patch release that addresses the following\n> security vulnerabilities:\n>\n> - CVE-2026-39886 HTJ2K Signed Integer Overflow in ht_undo_impl()\n> - CVE-2026-40244 Integer overflow in DWA setupChannelData planarUncRle\n>   pointer arithmetic (missed variant of CVE-2026-34589)\n> - CVE-2026-40250 Integer overflow in DWA decoder outBufferEnd pointer\n>   arithmetic (missed variant of CVE-2026-34589)\n",
